    "description": "HTTP Route Handlers for the gym engagement platform.\n\nServer Actions (internal UI mutations) are documented in docs/api/server-actions.md — they are not included here because they require Next.js action headers and a Clerk session.\n\nOpenAPI spec: openapi/openapi.yaml\n\nImport environments from postman/environments/ for baseUrl variables.",
